#: ../../source/for_users/advanced/index.rst:7
msgid "Installing Numba for local calculations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/for_users/advanced/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"Numba can speed up some local Trends.Earth calculations. It is not "
"included by default with the Trends.Earth installer given limitations on "
"packaging binaries for distribution via the standard QGIS repositories. "
"To use it, install it in the Python environment used by QGIS. Close QGIS "
"before installing packages, and restart it afterward."
msgstr ""

